<title>INDONESIA: Indonesian election count at 0700 GMT.</title>
<headline>Indonesian election count at 0700 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the Indonesian election figures with 109,668,262 ballots of a potential 125 million counted by 3 p.m. Saturday (0700 GMT):</p>
<p>Ruling Golkar party: 81,411,144 votes,  74.23 pct</p>
<p>United Development Party (PPP): 24,921,845 votes,  22.72 pct</p>
<p>Indonesian Democratic Party (PDI): 3,335,264 votes,   3.04 pct</p>
<p>Percentage results in Jakarta:</p>
<p>Golkar: 57.04 pct</p>
<p>PPP:    41.02 pct</p>
<p>PDI:     1.97 pct</p>
</text>
